<description>&lt;p&gt;Federal forces have seized additional Tigray towns while fighting continues, and severe drought and prolonged conflict are driving acute hunger in Amhara, Tigray and Afar. Ethiopian drones are now operating over Sudan and RSF drones are launching from Ethiopian territory against Sudanese targets, prompting diplomatic expulsions and consular closures. Drone and artillery strikes have been reported between Ethiopia and Eritrea near Badme, and cross-border attacks have spilled into Kenya, displacing thousands and killing civilians in Moyale. An RPG strike near a school in Moyale killed dozens of Ethiopian Orthodox believers and a Kenyan, and attacks on Orthodox Christians continue in Arsi, Benishangul Gumuz and the north, with blasts heard in Addis Ababa. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPNDNLYVFjMzVtckJFOVJ6b2hOaG9VMzFhM3Z0bzdHMkNjYVVwdk1WYVBWc3RUMXFLTmJKNUN2NTJiQmdWYlhpSC1NZmQ0VjJRNElLcTFSTGoyYVN6NE90NHU2Wng0c0hFMk1Qek9FU1E1SDg1dzNnMWJ0RGxTcVBYOExvc3BuNkw2U0paVlZMblFMWF9GTVR2VnBsRlQtaDVjN1otTVcwWU5NMGZYc3ZGUF9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBvR0ZFTTdYWHlfOVJZeWMxUnZDZ3NMZ2tnb1BYeFdSR3FzZ0FsQWZKYmNFYjdQUkhSVE5nMFFpS2RpQXhNRkN6ZnNlZlFPcnJQRi1jZ2hOb2hBVlVVN1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNUGVzemFrbHVZeTRzOGZXcnpNZFZ2ZVNwb3JYMDZONUZzblVDMVJBVngwcHZVRlhENUc0U19abmRjX2lpcFNiMktBa0htc1lYT0M4QU9Rd3FJSnNLSV84WnFBTGlFbDRYd2w0RC1PTUlubnA0YTh4ZU56UHdDX0dPdnFvLWdDQmIya2Z2X1h4YVh2MW14dmdIQ3BxalM5VllpUHVyV1BBRWNzRXZIekpEam5QWU04RVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/acc_10nov26_550_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organi